WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.850
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:35.340
Rebecca and Otogi challenge Valon to a duel.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:40.010
But they're no match for his Armor Deck, which is full of unknown abilities.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:42.950
Is he targeting Jonouchi?

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.730
Meanwhile, Kaiba is flying to a Florida museum in his private jet.

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:54.600
When an aurora reappears in the sky, dark clouds are ahead.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:02:01.800
Amelda's Revenge
Duel in the Sky

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:08.360
It's nice and cold.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.650
Are you okay?

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:13.610
I'm fine.  The cold will numb the pain-

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:17.920
Don't push yourself.  Let's rest for a while.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:19.820
Sorry, Yugi.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.450
I know you're in a hurry.

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:26.040
Don't worry.  Jonouchi should be nearby.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:45.780
Hey, Jonouchi.  You go first.

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:48.150
No, you first.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:51.860
You said you weren't scared of anything.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:55.420
Except long, slimy stuff!

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:17.340
When Duel Monsters went on a rampage, auroras appeared worldwide.

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:25.850
Big brother?

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:27.850
What's wrong, Captain?

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.390
Answer me, Captain!

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.870
I'll go check!

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.810
That's weird.  No one's here.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.170
Big brother...

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.710
What's wrong, Kaiba?

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:51.480
Why are you panicking?

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:53.240
I know that voice!

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:53.980
That punk!

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.480
Seems you now understand your situation, Kaiba.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:00.500
Amelda!  Where are you?  Show yourself!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.300
Big brother!  The cockpit!

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:22.810
Big brother...

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:25.810
It's on autopilot.

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:26.740
Kaiba.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.880
I'm not there.  I'm over here.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:34.410
He's so annoying.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:42.630
What are you doing?  I'm over here.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.130
I'll make you pay for this!

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.810
Nice to see you again, Seto Kaiba.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:00.210
Amelda!

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:03.310
What did you do with the crew?

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:07.400
We don't need extras on our stage.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:10.320
They were never on board.

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:11.660
What?

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:16.030
It was easy to do if you have the powers of Doma.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:17.660
Now, Kaiba...

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:20.360
Let's finish our duel.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:25.300
Due to you, my brother...

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.000
Your company killed him!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.010
Stop, Amelda!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:34.750
It's wrong for you and my brother to fight!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:39.480
I told you that I'll get my revenge.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:40.890
Amelda...

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:47.280
No matter what your intentions, a duel picks a winner fairly.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.640
The stronger one will win.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:50.770
Big brother!

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:52.430
Please!  Don't do this!

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:55.040
I accept your duel!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.210
Good to hear.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:07.440
Kaiba, I'll offer your soul to Mirko's grave!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.050
Big brother...

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:17.100
Duel!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.360
I'll go first!

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:21.400
I draw!

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.620
I summon Science Soldier in defense position!

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.060
I end my turn!

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.070
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:34.640
I summon X-Head Cannon in attack position!

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:38.810
Attack Science Soldier!

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:50.820
Why do Amelda and my brother have to fight?

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:53.220
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.830
I summon Cyber Soldier of Darkworld in defense position.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:02.330
I set a card and end my turn!

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.350
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:08.030
I summon Y-Dragon Head in attack position!

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:13.570
Y-Dragon Head attacks Cyber Soldier of Darkworld!

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:27.600
And X-Head Cannon attacks you directly!

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:42.970
I set a card and end my turn.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.980
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.880
Impressive, Kaiba.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:55.490
You already summoned two monsters and attacked me directly.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.720
And there's more to come, right?

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.020
If so, this room is too small.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.460
Let's fight somewhere more spacious.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:07.430
Don't tell me you drew that card!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:11.900
Get back, Mokuba!

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:14.320
Get back!

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.910
I activate The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.590
You punk!

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.420
What's this?

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:30.110
This dark card awakens dark souls.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:35.450
I'll show you the hell my brother and I lived through.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:38.610
Amelda, you punk!

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.370
Big brother!  Amelda!

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.370
Where'd you go, big brother?

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:01.880
The plane's flying down...  Can it be?

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:10.760
The autopilot is off!

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:16.600
No good!  It won't fly up!

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.100
Right!  The control tower!

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:21.030
I'll call the tower!

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:25.340
Please connect!

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:26.770
Please!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.500
Where am I?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.280
Hurry up.

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:15.970
Be careful.

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.160
Wait up!

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:27.970
I won't be fooled.

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:33.000
Amelda is showing me this lame illusion.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.040
Looks like he's awake.

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.810
If you're awake, leave.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:46.310
This is our secret lair.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.520
What's that junk?

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:57.900
They're not junk.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.430
We picked them up around the city.

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:04.360
There's still lots of useful things on the battlefield.

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:05.530
Dennis!

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:07.380
Battlefield...

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.830
Even those?

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:19.780
We give them to the soldiers protecting this city.

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:25.020
So that they'll drive away the enemy and end the war quickly.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:32.480
Chess?

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.560
You play chess?

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.950
What's your name?

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:38.770
Ewan.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.820
What are you doing, Ewan?

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:44.770
If you're done eating, go to the city and get more stuff!

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:47.380
You gather the least out of us!

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:48.190
But...

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.730
Just go.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:01.820
I know this is only an illusion.

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:05.980
Amelda is trying to faze me.

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:08.040
But...

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.890
What's wrong?

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:46.220
Tony and Dennis lost their parents in the war.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:51.560
But not just us.  Most of the kids in the city lost their parents.

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:57.300
But since I have Tony and Dennis, I don't feel lonely.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:03.280
Amelda, what are you trying to do to me?

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:05.420
You can play chess, right?

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.840
That was my chessboard.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.430
Let's play.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:27.910
This big one's king.  This is the queen.

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:31.580
Hmm...  I'll move this here.

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:34.580
Stop it!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.790
Checkmate.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.940
Again?

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.960
You're really tough!

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:48.720
It's your turn.

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:53.100
Hurry up.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.780
I knew it!

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:01.280
Then I'll move this here!

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.860
That's the church!

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:17.190
Tony!  Dennis!

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:34.940
Tony!  Dennis!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.640
Stop!  It's dangerous!

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.450
Tony!  Dennis!

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.390
Let me go!

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:42.450
Brother!

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:44.450
Mokuba!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:15.210
This is an illusion!

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:17.390
I don't believe in it, Amelda!

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:20.220
End this farce now!

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:25.220
Amelda!

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:41.900
Amelda!

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.260
Ewan.

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:50.490
Your illusion is lame!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:53.970
It's no illusion.  It really happened.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:58.490
That child was shot by a tank and died.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:16:59.940
What?

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:03.060
That wasn't unusual in this city.

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:06.000
My brother Mirko died too.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:10.500
Let's continue the game, Kaiba.

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:19.220
I used KC-1 Crayton and my trap card, Tank Corps to summon three Tokens.

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.750
And I attacked your Y-Dragon Head.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:28.750
KC-1 Crayton gains 500 attack points per Token.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:32.490
So you lose 2000 life points.

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:41.640
I set a card and end my turn!

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.550
Kaiba, it's your turn.

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:07.890
My turn!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:10.730
I activate the spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:13.740
I revive Y-Dragon Head!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:18.240
And I summon Z-Metal Tank!

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:27.410
I combine X-Head Cannon, Y-Dragon Head and Z-Metal Tank!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:43.460
I Special Summon XYZ-Dragon Cannon!

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:47.470
I activate XYZ-Dragon Cannon's effect!

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:52.840
I discard a card from my hand to destroy a card on your field!

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:05.370
Since the Tokens are destroyed, KC-1 Crayton's attack points decrease!

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:11.360
XYZ-Dragon Cannon attacks KC-1 Crayton!

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:16.260
Destroy it!  XYZ Hyper Cannon!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:43.400
Kaiba, the anger and hatred you felt was throughout the battlefield.

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:46.180
That's where we lived.

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:49.500
All I did was play my turn!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:50.990
This is a duel!

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:54.510
For me, it was reality.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:20:03.310
On the battlefield, I prayed for a world free of weapons.

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:07.410
For a peaceful world without war.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.420
But that's impossible.

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:14.930
There will always be people like Gozaburo Kaiba.

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:18.090
From now and forever!

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:22.980
There'll always be weapons.  People won't stop having wars.

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:26.610
In that case, I'll get rid of the world!

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:30.930
And rebuild a world without war from scratch!

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:33.440
That's what I realized-

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:37.280
Actually, Doma made me realize!

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:41.360
That I need your soul to achieve this world!

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:49.870
Mokuba!

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:01.430
Oh yeah!

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:11.720
Mokuba!

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:12.890
Kaiba!

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:15.050
The match isn't over yet!

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:20.460
I'll play my special card next turn to end you.

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:25.690
And I'll steal your soul to return this world to nothing!

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.170
My turn!

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:39.480
I draw!

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:09.180
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:17.590
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:28.680
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:38.200
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:38.770 --> 00:22:47.230
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:52.740
I'll live feeling them

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:57.920
For me to be me

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:06.380
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:07.060 --> 00:23:12.020
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:12.540 --> 00:23:21.750
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:28.680 --> 00:23:34.840
Due to Amelda's attack, Kaiba's plane is out of control and losing altitude.

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:38.270
Mokuba can't regain control on his own!

00:23:38.270 --> 00:23:44.050
But Kaiba can't escape from the Seal unless he defeats Amelda in a duel.

00:23:44.050 --> 00:23:47.650
And Amelda is about to summon his special card!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:50.000
That monster is...!

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:53.010
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Air Fortress Ziggurat

00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:54.680
Duel, standby!
